<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Get Well Soon Miya! ❤️</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 99%, #fecfef 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out;
        }

        .heart-icon {
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #d63384;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #ff6b81;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 107, 129, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #ff4757;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .popup-text {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff4757;
            display: none;
            animation: popUp 0.5s ease-out forwards;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.15); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes popUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="heart-icon">💖</div>
        <h1>GWS yah sayangg 💕</h1>
        <p>
            Cepat sembuh yaa, Miya... Jangan lupa istirahat yang cukup, minum obatnya, dan makan yang banyak. Ada yang kangen sama senyum kamu nih!
        </p>
        
        <button class="btn" onclick="kirimPeluk()">Pencet Ini Coba 💌</button>
        
        <div class="popup-text" id="popup">
            Virtual hug & kiss dikirim buat Miya! 🤗✨
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function kirimPeluk() {
            const popup = document.getElementById('popup');
            popup.style.display = 'block';
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
